{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10413130","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10413130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041313001:1":{"text":"로잔, 에스페리아 각지를 여행하다니, 정말 부러워. 난 선생님이 된 후로 바투소를 떠난 적이 없어.","source_cn":"洛桑，真羡慕你能在伊索米亚各地游历。自从当了老师，我就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52CF4DB8ACE27C60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041313002:1":{"text":"너처럼 자유롭게 여행하는 건 꿈도 못 꿔. 이럴 때 각 지역의 정취를 즐길 수 있는 뭔가가 있다면 얼마나 좋을까...","source_cn":"我不奢望能像你那样自由出行，但如果有办法能让我领略各地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA28542A7CDC5B6B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041313003:1":{"text":"그렇게 애잔한 눈으로 보지 마... 알겠어, 다음에 특산품 좀 보내줄게.","source_cn":"别用那种哀怨的眼神看着我……好吧，好吧，我会记得给你寄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x648FDC70C913FB7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041313004:1":{"text":"좋아~ 약속했다! 새로운 곳에 도착할 때마다 특산품 하나씩 보내줘야 해!","source_cn":"好呀~就这么说定了！记住，每到一个新地方，都要给我寄一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x079332B30F1621B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041313005:1":{"text":"아, 알겠어... 잠깐, 왜 갑자기 당한 기분이 들지?!","source_cn":"嗯、嗯……等等，我怎么觉得你是故意骗我答应你的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF10602897B0F4DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芙拉贝尔":{"text":"프라벨","source":"芙拉贝尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}